  body: "# Social Fund payment decisions in the captured guide\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe Social Fund
    introduction distinguishes the listed maternity, funeral and heating expenses from other needs decided under
    separate directions, and lists payment claims decided by a decision maker with appeal rights.\n\n## Scope and
    exceptions\n\nThis is the scope of the captured introduction, not a complete current directory of assistance.
    The substantive text inspected here concerns funeral payments and Winter Fuel Payments. Devolved provision,
    Sure Start Maternity Grant and Cold Weather Payment dependencies remain unresolved; not all Social Fund needs
    follow one decision route.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 39001, PDF page 2](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=2).\n\
    - [DMG 39002, PDF page 2](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=2).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol7-ch39`:
    PDF `ab13db0cf4d33fd90fb4cd8a90b909af568d39169f617f4b86b1037278d3fa9f`; extracted pages `625425d7933417f8895628354b1be65fc86df4d1f97a55acb13426d6cbe2b8a7`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:28.411887Z`.\n"
